  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Islands phase three</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity delivers nature-based solutions, underpinned by traditional knowledge, to support the adaptation and disaster risk reduction aspirations of communities. Building on the impact and learnings in the current programme, the next phase of Climate Resilient Islands will likely deliver in the existing six countries (Fiji, Vanuatu, Tonga, Tuvalu, Papua New Guinea and Solomon Islands) while adding in additional communities through its Partner Training Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
